"The installed XTimers app’s About screen shows the included XHelpers Pro benefit." = "Om-skjermen i den installerte XTimers-appen viser den inkluderte XHelpers Pro-fordelen.";
"The live opt-in screen shows the exact consent language above, the phone\n      number field, an unchecked affirmative checkbox, SMS Terms and Privacy\n      Policy links, STOP/HELP wording, message-frequency and message/data-rate\n      disclosures, and the owner-phone-only SMS scope." = "Live opt-in-skjermen viser den eksakte samtykketeksten ovenfor, telefonnummerfeltet, en ukrysset bekreftelsesboks, SMS Lenker til Vilkår og personvern, STOP/HELP formulering, meldingsfrekvens- og melding-/datahastighetsopplysninger, og eier-telefon-kun SMS omfang.";
